  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The works to which this consent relates, must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this consent.\r\nReason: To accord with the provisions of Section 18(1) of the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation areas) Act 1990.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: Osterley Underground Station Location Plan, Osterley Underground Station Block Plan, Heritage Statement, OPO Draft Listed Building Consents Submission, Existing and End State Platform 1, Existing and End State Platform 2, Removal of Redundant Equipment Plan, Camera Position Plan, Platform 1 End Removal, Platform 2 End Removal Received 12 June 2024.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission."
